notes.content:
1. Optimized the display effect of the beginner tutorial;
2. Adjusted the quick release keys of the in-game magic card from "6" and "7" to "Q" and "W";
3. Fixed some in-game bugs.

1. Added a new survey button to the main interface of the game, and now players can jump to the survey through the in-game button;
2. Optimized the detection range of button interaction on the main interface;
3. Optimized the interaction between tower and magic card selection, now the order of in-game shortcuts will be displayed after selection;
4. The entire construction progress will now be retained after the construction of towers is stopped;
5. Adjusted some stats, weakened the Arrow Tower, and strengthened the Construction Workshop;
6. Fixed some game bugs.
